{"at":"2026-10-26T08:36:07.491Z","posts":[{"id":119520,"slug":"indias-office-market-moves-towards-balanced-secto","date_gmt":"2026-10-26T08:06:25","modified_gmt":"2026-10-26T08:06:27","link":"https://realtynmore.com/indias-office-market-moves-towards-balanced-secto/","title":{"rendered":"India’s Office Market Moves Towards Balanced Sectoral Mix as BFSI and Flex Spaces Take 40% Share in Q3 2026: Vestian"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>New Delhi, October 26, 2026: India’s office market experienced a shift in occupier demand across sectors in Q3 2026, signaling a gradual diversification of market demand, according to a press release by Vestian Research. While IT-ITeS remained the largest contributor to pan-India absorption, its share declined to 23% from 41% in Q2 2026 and 31% <a href=\"https://realtynmore.com/indias-office-market-moves-towards-balanced-secto/\" class=\"more-link\">&#8230;<span class=\"screen-reader-text\">  India’s Office Market Moves Towards Balanced Sectoral Mix as BFSI and Flex Spaces Take 40% Share in Q3 2026: Vestian</span></a></p>\n"},"categories":[1],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://realtynmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/images-2026-10-26T133334.566.jpg","alt_text":"","media_details":{"width":738,"height":414,"sizes":{"medium":{"file":"images-2026-10-26T133334.566-374x210.jpg","width":374,"height":210,"filesize":24227,"mime_type":"image/jpeg","source_url":"https://realtynmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/images-2026-10-26T133334.566-374x210.jpg"},"thumbnail":{"file":"images-2026-10-26T133334.566-150x84.jpg","width":150,"height":84,"filesize":5206,"mime_type":"image/jpeg","source_url":"https://realtynmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/images-2026-10-26T133334.566-150x84.jpg"},"full":{"file":"images-2026-10-26T133334.566.jpg","width":738,"height":414,"mime_type":"image/jpeg","source_url":"https://realtynmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/images-2026-10-26T133334.566.jpg"}}}}],"wp:term":[[{"id":1,"name":"News","slug":"news","taxonomy":"category"}],[]]}},{"id":119516,"slug":"gb-realty-unveils-punjabs-first-jacob-co-brand","date_gmt":"2026-10-26T08:03:04","modified_gmt":"2026-10-26T08:03:06","link":"https://realtynmore.com/gb-realty-unveils-punjabs-first-jacob-co-brand/","title":{"rendered":"GB Realty Unveils Punjab’s First Jacob &#038; Co.-Branded Luxury Residences in Mohali"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Chandigarh, October 26, 2026: Punjab-based real estate developer GB Realty has announced a luxury residential development on Airport Road, Mohali, in collaboration with global luxury watch and jewelry brand Jacob &amp; Co., according to a press release. The company is positioning the development as Punjab’s first branded residences project. The development marks GB Realty’s entry <a href=\"https://realtynmore.com/gb-realty-unveils-punjabs-first-jacob-co-brand/\" class=\"more-link\">&#8230;<span class=\"screen-reader-text\">  GB Realty Unveils Punjab’s First Jacob &#038; Co.-Branded Luxury Residences in Mohali</span></a></p>\n"},"categories":[1],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://realtynmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Jacob-Co-and-Gurinder-Bhatti-Founder-and-Managing-Director-GB-Realty.jpeg","alt_text":"","media_details":{"width":1280,"height":796,"sizes":{"medium":{"file":"Jacob-Co-and-Gurinder-Bhatti-Founder-and-Managing-Director-GB-Realty-354x220.jpeg","width":354,"height":220,"filesize":22233,"mime_type":"image/jpeg","source_url":"https://realtynmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Jacob-Co-and-Gurinder-Bhatti-Founder-and-Managing-Director-GB-Realty-354x220.jpeg"},"large":{"file":"Jacob-Co-and-Gurinder-Bhatti-Founder-and-Managing-Director-GB-Realty-1024x637.jpeg","width":1024,"height":637,"filesize":116050,"mime_type":"image/jpeg","source_url":"https://realtynmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Jacob-Co-and-Gurinder-Bhatti-Founder-and-Managing-Director-GB-Realty-1024x637.jpeg"},"thumbnail":{"file":"Jacob-Co-and-Gurinder-Bhatti-Founder-and-Managing-Director-G